    "text": "you are doing a local function."
  },
  {
    "start": 402.0,
    "end": 404.0,
    "text": "So, the scope is only within the scope."
  },
  {
    "start": 404.0,
    "end": 406.0,
    "text": "Nobody knows it."
  },
  {
    "start": 406.0,
    "end": 408.0,
    "text": "And you can say lifetime,"
  },
  {
    "start": 408.0,
    "end": 410.0,
    "text": "like you are going to go to a global lifetime."
  },
  {
    "start": 410.0,
    "end": 412.0,
    "text": "Because, as I have declared it,"
  },
  {
    "start": 412.0,
    "end": 414.0,
    "text": "I am calling it somewhere."
  },
  {
    "start": 414.0,
    "end": 416.0,
    "text": "I am always executing it."
  },
  {
    "start": 416.0,
    "end": 418.0,
    "text": "So, this is the entire lifetime."
  },
  {
    "start": 418.0,
    "end": 420.0,
    "text": "Because, as long as it is not written,"
  },
  {
    "start": 420.0,
    "end": 422.0,
    "text": "it will exist in memory."
  },
  {
    "start": 422.0,
    "end": 424.0,
    "text": "As long as it is written,"
  },
  {
    "start": 424.0,
    "end": 426.0,
    "text": "it will be destroyed automatically."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.0,
    "end": 428.0,
    "text": "So, this is all about the"
  },
  {
    "start": 428.0,
    "end": 430.0,
    "text": "scoping and lifetime of our variables."
  },
  {
    "start": 430.0,
    "end": 432.0,
    "text": "Thank you."
  }
]